    // fan_in (vehicle-01/thruster-l): §11.2: egress is checked by inclusion against the query's or subscription's own key expression, so every consumer or caller selector that intersects this provider's keys, and that its own patterns do not include, is granted here; without it a fan-in GET gets 0 replies (spike S14)
    { id: "fan-in:vehicle-01/thruster-l", permission: "allow", flows: ["egress"],
